   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Reform of Civil Service</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Lograr una gestin coherente, flexible e integrada de los recursos humanos de la Administracin Central mediante el establecimiento del marco normativo e institucional necesario y la implantacin de sistemas de gestin adecuados.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To achieve a coherent, flexible and integrated management of Central Government&apos;s human resources, by means of the establishment of a normative and institutional frame and the implementation of adequate management systems</narrative>
  </description>
